name 'iterating-with-ai-postassessment-q10_2025'

question 'A developer wants to filter a list but realizes the original "Master List" has been permanently changed. What did they likely fail to do?'

right 'They failed to use a "copy-not-mutate" strategy.'
wrong 'They used too many pure functions.'
wrong 'They forgot to use a `for` loop.'
wrong 'They set the stopping condition to `i < 10`.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lesson 8

To keep data safe, developers should create a copy of the original dataset for filtering or sorting, rather than "mutating" (changing) the original source.
MARKDOWN
